/vendor/
/tmp/

# The contributor skills under `.claude/skills/` are version-controlled, but a developer's global
# excludesfile commonly ignores `.claude` wholesale, which leaves skills tracked only because they
# were force-added once and makes any NEW skill file invisible to `git status`. Re-include the
# directory here so the repository decides, then keep everything else in it out:
# `settings.local.json` holds per-machine tool permissions, and the desktop app creates checkouts
# under `.claude/worktrees/`.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
